        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Earth, it was discovered that many stars in the Milky Way began to explode and disappear for unknown reasons. The reconnaissance spaceship <i>Celeste</i> was sent to investigate the nearest vanished star Procyon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the pilots of this spaceship. Something happens during the flight, and you wake up in a cryo capsule with the sound of alarm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clothes. No weapons. No nothing. Only an unknown threat ahead — and creeping, icy terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.poster.avif?t=1771231272\" width=1146 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.webm?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.mp4?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is important in the game, especially at the beginning when you have almost nothing. The monsters are very strong, and they react to the sounds you make. Don't shine your flashlight near them. Distract monsters by throwing objects - they'll follow the sound to check it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacesuit main controls very simple. 1. Stop all movement and rotation holding Space. 2. Rotate your spacesuit to the direction you want to move holding middle mouse button. (this rotate spacesuit to the direction you're looking at) 3. Add thrust holding W. When you reach desired location - repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also you can watch short video tutorial and other controls in Menu/Settings/Spacesuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tip: At the beginning of the game, you don't have any good weapons, so don't try to kill monsters. Instead, avoid them or use your wits — use mechanisms to kill them, or airlocks to throw them into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.poster.avif?t=1771231272\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.webm?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.mp4?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive in an unknown and hostile environment,  resolve mystery of black hole, complete your mission and finally, find a way to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/5d90e79cc0d0ba88d72496565d57c62a.avif?t=1771231272\" width=908 height=426 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Earth, it was discovered that many stars in the Milky Way began to explode and disappear for unknown reasons. The reconnaissance spaceship <i>Celeste</i> was sent to investigate the nearest vanished star Procyon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the pilots of this spaceship. Something happens during the flight, and you wake up in a cryo capsule with the sound of alarm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clothes. No weapons. No nothing. Only an unknown threat ahead — and creeping, icy terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.poster.avif?t=1771231272\" width=1146 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.webm?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/92a718a06f35e1a24ebba1ced98ceb5d.mp4?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is important in the game, especially at the beginning when you have almost nothing. The monsters are very strong, and they react to the sounds you make. Don't shine your flashlight near them. Distract monsters by throwing objects - they'll follow the sound to check it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacesuit main controls very simple. 1. Stop all movement and rotation holding Space. 2. Rotate your spacesuit to the direction you want to move holding middle mouse button. (this rotate spacesuit to the direction you're looking at) 3. Add thrust holding W. When you reach desired location - repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also you can watch short video tutorial and other controls in Menu/Settings/Spacesuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tip: At the beginning of the game, you don't have any good weapons, so don't try to kill monsters. Instead, avoid them or use your wits — use mechanisms to kill them, or airlocks to throw them into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.poster.avif?t=1771231272\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.webm?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/abb3b140f4bdfd8348aae68e6e885d78.mp4?t=1771231272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive in an unknown and hostile environment,  resolve mystery of black hole, complete your mission and finally, find a way to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403780/extras/5d90e79cc0d0ba88d72496565d57c62a.avif?t=1771231272\" width=908 height=426 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "A first-person sci-fi space horror where every mistake can be fatal. Derelict ships. Hostile lifeforms. No second chances. A nonlinear adventure and psychological horror where the player pieces together clues to understand what’s happening — and how to survive.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“Warped – Space Horror is a disciplined, atmospheric descent into sci-fi dread that understands the power of suggestion. It does not aim to overwhelm or entertain in conventional ways; instead, it seeks to unsettle, disorient, and linger in the player’s mind. Its restraint is its greatest strength, even if that same restraint limits its appeal.”<br>4/5 – Gamecritix<br>",
